---
---
<section class="section-final-equipment" id="inquiry">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fe-wrapper">
      
      <div class="fe-header">
        <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 2rem; background: transparent; border-color: var(--text-dark); color: var(--brand-navy); border-radius: 0;">
          Cererea dumneavoastră
        </span>
        <h2 class="fe-title">
          De ce produse aveți nevoie și cum vor fi utilizate?
        </h2>
        <p class="fe-desc">
          Vă rugăm să ne comunicați categoria, cantitatea aproximativă, domeniul de utilizare și termenul limită. Dacă aveți un logo sau fișiere grafice, puteți menționa și acest lucru.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Typographic Variable Grid -->
      <div class="fe-variables">
        <div class="var-item">
          <span class="var-label">01. Categorie</span>
          <span class="var-line"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="var-item">
          <span class="var-label">02. Cantitate</span>
          <span class="var-line"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="var-item">
          <span class="var-label">03. Utilizare</span>
          <span class="var-line"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="var-item">
          <span class="var-label">04. Termen</span>
          <span class="var-line"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="fe-action-wrapper">
        <a href="/contact/" class="fe-cta">
          Discutați echiparea companiei
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="fe-reassurance">
        <img src="/images/gabriel-antonio-pop.png" alt="Gabriel Pop" class="fe-avatar">
        <span>Gabriel Pop vă va răspunde personal.</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-final-equipment {
    padding: 8rem 0 10rem;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .fe-wrapper {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .fe-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .fe-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .fe-desc {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .fe-variables {
    width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .var-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .var-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .var-line {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .fe-action-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .fe-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .fe-cta:hover {
    color: var(--brand-purple);
  }
  .fe-cta svg {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .fe-cta:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(12px);
  }

  .fe-reassurance {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .fe-avatar {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 0;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .fe-variables {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .fe-cta svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>

